※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4527 LANG_CALL_UNKNOWN_PARAMETER

※ A name a generic function's parameters do not have is refused, as it is for
※ any function.

fn same(v: T') → T':
    v

let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup, impure]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    if same(.value ← 1u8) = 1u8: 0u6 else: 1u6
